{
  "id": "div_badge_vertical",
  "name": "Division Badge (Vertical)",
  "cardSizeId": "v54x86",
  "background": "@white",
  "_comment": [
    "Modelled on the Sacred Heart Convent reference set, where the same card is",
    "issued in one colour per division so a teacher can spot a wrong card across",
    "a room. Every coloured band here uses @divAccent, which resolves to the",
    "student's division colour when the school has configured them and falls back",
    "to the school header colour when it has not.",
    "",
    "Vertical budget (54 x 86 mm):",
    "  header       0.0 -> 17.0",
    "  photo panel 17.0 -> 58.0   dark panel, photo centred inside it",
    "  accent bar  58.0 -> 61.5",
    "  DIV badge   61.0 -> 66.5   overlaps the bar, as in the reference",
    "  fields      67.5 -> 82.0",
    "  footer      83.0 -> 86.0"
  ],
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "rect",
      "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 54, "h": 17,
      "fill": "@divAccent"
    },
    {
      "type": "logo",
      "x": 42.5, "y": 1.2, "w": 10, "h": 10
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2.5, "y": 2.6, "w": 39, "h": 7,
      "value": "{schoolName}",
      "size": 8,
      "bold": true,
      "color": "@white",
      "align": "left",
      "maxLines": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2.5, "y": 10.4, "w": 46, "h": 5.6,
      "value": "{addressLine}",
      "size": 4.4,
      "color": "@white",
      "align": "left",
      "maxLines": 2
    },

    {
      "type": "rect",
      "x": 0, "y": 17, "w": 54, "h": 41,
      "fill": "#2E1A55"
    },
    {
      "type": "photo",
      "x": 11.76, "y": 18.4, "w": 30.48, "h": 38.1,
      "borderWidth": 0.35,
      "borderColor": "@white"
    },

    {
      "type": "rect",
      "x": 0, "y": 58, "w": 54, "h": 3.5,
      "fill": "@divAccent"
    },
    {
      "type": "rect",
      "x": 14, "y": 60.4, "w": 26, "h": 6.2,
      "fill": "#2E1A55",
      "radius": 3.1
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 14, "y": 60.4, "w": 26, "h": 6.2,
      "value": "DIV-{division}",
      "size": 7.5,
      "bold": true,
      "color": "@white",
      "align": "center",
      "requires": "division"
    },

    {
      "type": "nameBanner",
      "x": 3, "y": 67.4, "w": 48, "h": 4.4,
      "size": 8,
      "color": "@primary",
      "align": "center"
    },
    {
      "type": "fields",
      "x": 3.5, "y": 72.2, "w": 47, "h": 10.4,
      "labelWidth": 14,
      "rowGap": 0.5,
      "showLabels": true,
      "exclude": ["name", "division"]
    },

    {
      "type": "rect",
      "x": 0, "y": 83, "w": 54, "h": 3,
      "fill": "@divAccent"
    }
  ]
}
